## Final Status
- Completed: 2026-09-30
- Tests: ✓ (All tests passing; Vite build succeeded cleanly)
- Security review: ✓ (Client-side presentation layer; gated routes)
- UI Standard: ✓ (Strict adherence to DaisyUI 5 components: btn, card, badge, table, modal, select, input)
- Known limitations: Backend DB persistence for new programs/colleges deferred as explicitly instructed ("just the UI, no backend").

## Lessons & Notes
- Extracting directory, matrix table, header stats, and modal dialogs into granular partials made each file compact (< 140 lines) and effortless to maintain.
- Pre-populating the full 17-college BU dataset with 127 degree programs makes the interface immediately feel authentic and aligned with the provided screenshot.
